  "details": "<p>The Barrington Atlas Directory notes: Quadri</p>\r\n<div>\u00a0</div>\r\n<div>The medieval church of Maddona dello Spineto was built atop the podium of an Italic temple. The actual ancient name of the site remains debated.</div>",
